{"time": 1754153617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1878311672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "忽然蹲下来，然后偷偷抓一把雪攥手心里"}
{"time": 1754153671, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1746084548", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1075111807]\"对这种无谓的东西你倒是想的很多。\"他打个响指，\"能不能回忆一下那个炼金术的基础呢？\""}
{"time": 1754153764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "599525768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（等价交换）"}
{"time": 1754153772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1780102037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"作为禁忌的炼金术，也不例外会遵循所谓等价交换。构成人体的材料或许你已齐备，但，那样的人体呢？\"他指着你，但你知道他指的是门后的东西，\"霞龙的后裔，真有意思。\""}
{"time": 1754153799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "406629512", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，我刚打到一半）"}
{"time": 1754153833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "701230037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1878311672]她几乎立刻察觉到你的想法，率先抓起一把雪拍在你脸上，紧接着就要甩开你的手"}
{"time": 1754153857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "166836336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我本来是打算）"}
{"time": 1754153868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1404331678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（“等价交换，不用你提醒……我”）"}
{"time": 1754153869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "983011035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（的）"}
{"time": 1754153896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1615934355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“啊”被冻得叫起来“好阴险啊你..”但是不松手，迅速站起来，把那把雪从她后脖颈塞进去"}
{"time": 1754153911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "854142930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……只有我不行”*皱眉“没有人愿意对她负责了”"}
{"time": 1754153951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "991171437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1615934355]那你过个力量"}
{"time": 1754153960, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2092843616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd+1 力量"}
{"time": 1754153960, "type": "reply", "message_id": "2092843616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[露儿]使用[力量]演奏出:[1D20+1={15}+1=16]"}
{"time": 1754153990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1413860166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嘿嘿，让你见识下真正的寒冷”"}
{"time": 1754154061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "328274421", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=854142930]\"嘛嘛，沐浴龙血如此，你不仅要找到等价的龙血。\"他似乎没什么兴趣了，转身往外走，\"还要能献上的灵魂，这才是称为禁忌的原因，算是我给你的回报如何?\""}
{"time": 1754154082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "26553607", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd+1"}
{"time": 1754154082, "type": "reply", "message_id": "26553607", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上绘梨花]演奏出: 1D20+1={11}+1=12"}
{"time": 1754154198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1695831015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1413860166]\"诶诶!快放手!\"挣不开，\"嘶...\"露莉亚全身被突如其来的刺激冻得发抖，\"你完了!\"但反击来的迅速，趁你立足未稳，她直接撞向你试图把你扑倒到雪地上"}
{"time": 1754154246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "616290648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "倒地的时候抱着她“那我们一起倒吧”"}
{"time": 1754154255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "645532938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……谁来主持”*放弃般叹口气，大概是抛弃了不切实际的幻想"}
{"time": 1754154383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "775244567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=645532938]\"当然是你，伊芙小姐，你可是我们重要的合作伙伴。\"他停在暗处，你看不清他的表情，也无从分辨话语中的感情，\"带着你的人去这个地方。\"一张折起来的纸扔在你脚边，\"有你想要的东西。\""}
{"time": 1754154447, "type": "recv", "message_id": "583389554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=616290648]那她压在你身上，你的后背立刻和雪地来了个亲密接触，棉袄和头发都沾到大片雪渍"}
{"time": 1754154501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "393024447", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嘶....好冰...你快起来啦...”"}
{"time": 1754154608, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1050806489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=393024447]\"不行哦。\"她从容地抓起更多的雪扫到你的脸上"}
{"time": 1754154659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "656780182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "抓住她往旁边滚一圈"}
