{"time": 1754161534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "860486479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不能睡啊，现在可是雪天啊”紧紧抱住她，然后掐她几下"}
{"time": 1754161561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1305569702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1353113464]她低头看着你，\"那家伙还说你很有资质，没想到一点才能都没有吗？\"她的靴子勾起你的下巴，\"只有欲望称得上及格呢\""}
{"time": 1754161588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2048669829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=860486479]\"没...没有...诺诺，带我...带我一起\""}
