{"time": 1754162254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "414811538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1688684229]\"大家...还好吗？\"露莉亚好像没有看见刚刚的画面，抬头问你，\"好腥...发生什么..了?"}
{"time": 1754162310, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1077875250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "为什么，为什么，大家明明都是那么好的人，为什么会发生这种事情，刚刚那个人好像提到了什么暗影议会，是因为他们吗，心绪很乱，感觉就像天忽然塌了一样..."}
{"time": 1754162320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1230693826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=738175521]尽管你的意志想要反抗，但身体还是第一时间停下了动作，一动不动，\"不乖哦?\"她低下头看着你"}
{"time": 1754162348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "437472657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我还是不过骰子，要是输了好尴尬)"}
{"time": 1754162363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "804131752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我教你，+20）"}
{"time": 1754162388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1105704121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1077875250]\"诺..诺?\"她的声音继续从你怀中传出"}
{"time": 1754162392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1034268761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...”张了张嘴，但什么都没说出来，只是一个劲的逃跑，但眼泪大颗大颗的往下掉"}
{"time": 1754162425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "759045956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1034268761]似乎是感受到了温热的眼泪，怀中的人也安静下来，有些死寂"}
{"time": 1754162640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1352694368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "一个劲的朝着远离村子的地方跑，跑到跑不动为止...."}
{"time": 1754162641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1254157107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1230693826]“……”万策尽，如今的自己和待宰的羔羊没什么区别。大概这个时候，只有泪腺还没游离于大脑的操纵外运作吧，于是颤抖着无声地落泪"}
{"time": 1754162670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1747079361", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1352694368]你感觉到怀中的人渐渐失温，呼吸逐渐减缓"}
{"time": 1754162748, "type": "recv", "message_id": "118488311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1254157107]\"为什么要哭?\"她手里把玩着菱晶，但是没有第一时间做什么，而是看着你，\"明明感觉你很有趣，现在又好无聊诶。\""}
{"time": 1754162769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1063805594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（被资本做局了）"}
{"time": 1754162791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1856279887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦?忘了忘了。\"她笑着拍拍你的脑袋，你感觉到身体又可以活动了"}
{"time": 1754162849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "358841738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1747079361]“露莉亚...别放弃啊”带着哭腔的说着“别留我一个人....”"}
{"time": 1754162867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "667750978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "抱住她，试图把体温传递给她..."}
{"time": 1754162915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "135954512", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不要....说不定，只是我搞错了而已.....”"}
{"time": 1754162964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "595131686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=667750978]杯水车薪，但她终究颤抖着嘴唇开口，\"诺...诺...\"此处离村子已经相当远，处在下山的路边"}
{"time": 1754163105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1634767489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1856279887]“你要……做什么？刚刚的和你们是什么关系”*四肢并用地向后蛄蛹，把最后一枚毒球有望做无望地藏在袖子里"}
{"time": 1754163179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1034636012", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“别睡，求求你了...”听到她的声音感觉顿时灰暗的人生中出现了一道光“慢慢说，别急...我不会让你死的....我一定不会让你死的”已经不知道到底是在对露莉亚说还是对自己说的“山下肯定有医生，在撑一下，你肯定不会有事的....”语速越来越快，虽然已经很累了，但开始往山下去"}
{"time": 1754163289, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1949622593", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1034636012]\"我好累...好黑...好...好像看见..爸爸..和妈妈...\"她断断续续开口，\"诺诺...露莉亚要..."}
{"time": 1754163363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "288531045", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1634767489]\"和我们没关系哦?\"她好笑地看着你的动作，\"你把这玩意解放了出来，有这种的后果当然不意外。\"你的目光不自觉地固定到她手上的晶体"}
{"time": 1754163433, "type": "recv", "message_id": "445650371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"所以说，人都是你杀的啦。\"你看到她居然有些困了，\"本来觉得你是特殊的，现在看来...哈～好无聊。\""}
{"time": 1754163439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1750621892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不要...在撑一...小下就....好了，就一小..下....”低温下超负荷空腹运动，自己的状态也不是很好了“别..丢下...我”"}
{"time": 1754163463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1003618645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“别丢我...一个人...”"}
{"time": 1754163483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "570543291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1750621892]你脚下踉跄，抱着她扑倒在地上，\"...\""}
{"time": 1754163557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "683419662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=288531045]*用雪把脸上的水渍擦干“……和我没关系，那老头自己不把话说清楚”"}
{"time": 1754163557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1529544986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露莉亚，露莉亚”连滚带爬的到她身边"}
{"time": 1754163655, "type": "recv", "message_id": "80430043", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "雪越下越深，短短的时间就在她身上留下了被子，你分明感觉到她的生命已经垂危"}
{"time": 1754163670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1266436757", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=745665608]“不要睡...你是在骗我的对吗，就像刚刚一样，快告诉我你是在骗我的.....”"}
{"time": 1754163677, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1936793662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（call back）"}
{"time": 1754163731, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1442990466", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=683419662]\"明明就是你做的吧，我一直有在看着哦?\"她捧着一边的脸，露出了欠揍的笑，\"推卸责任这点也很有趣呢\""}
{"time": 1754163741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1274060759", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1266436757]当然毫无回应"}
{"time": 1754163749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "391933255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "过个幸运吧"}
{"time": 1754163755, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1072884802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把她抱起来，然后脱掉外套给她套在外面，然后继续抱着她下山"}
{"time": 1754163761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1285778739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd+1"}
{"time": 1754163761, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1285778739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[露儿]演奏出: 1D20+1={2}+1=3"}
{"time": 1754163766, "type": "recv", "message_id": "560278790", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（很绝望了）"}
{"time": 1754163770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "270137451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那很绝望了)"}
{"time": 1754163784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1251313839", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我今晚的出目没一个像人的）"}
{"time": 1754163797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1055513148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我翅膀能飞吗，我想带她飞一段了）"}
{"time": 1754163835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1565641826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1072884802]寒风凛冽，穿着单衣的你瑟瑟发抖，但是盖起的衣衫总算是吊住了露莉亚的呼吸，只是并非长久之计"}
{"time": 1754163849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "501199564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你都没用过那个翅膀吧？不过你也可以尝试)"}
{"time": 1754163856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1453950156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(建议你什么都试试，都这样了)"}
{"time": 1754163868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1633354980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "卸下自己的发带"}
{"time": 1754163871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "877020542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1442990466]“死了就死了，区区人类，和我有什么关系，和你有什么关系？”*突然烦躁起来，跳起来去夺她手里的龙晶"}
{"time": 1754163921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "274781638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "还有个翅膀，如果可以飞的话...肯定可以把她带到附近的村子里，虽然基本没有用过那个翅膀，但还是尝试一番"}
{"time": 1754163929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2113542802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1633354980]背后凭空出现了一对小翅膀和尾巴，头上有小角"}
{"time": 1754163936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1117997354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（飞行过什么呢）"}
