{"time": 1754164158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1977570917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(让我看看命运的天平在哪里)"}
{"time": 1754164165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1226172135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（在16）"}
{"time": 1754164308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "757049356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=423659984]“……所以她死了，那些人对不住她，所以我才不管”"}
{"time": 1754164325, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1918609658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦?感受到动静过来一趟，没想到还有两个女孩在这?一个魔族一个...嗯...\"你看见下山的路上突兀地出现了一个人的身影"}
{"time": 1754164388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "347373508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "好像看到了希望的曙光“求求你，救救我朋友，她快死了，求求你了”看到那个人直接过去求救"}
{"time": 1754164450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1723472704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“只要你能救她，让我做什么都可以......”"}
{"time": 1754164642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1928712116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=757049356]\"啊，好拼命的戏码，好感动。\"她像是要掉出眼泪了，但紧接着又恢复了毫无表情，\"我可以帮你，要交易吗？\""}
{"time": 1754164661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "433956365", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=65BD793AC4F97A9FC7E56A95C94980D1.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTar432OhSWsXivoLO4lh595dRuzhj8-wMg_woorqm9y_TsjgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQN6VPj-l5dGWjHAZ2wHthoHoC3Rk&amp;rkey=CAISMF12TtzYGumaPYS_jfNMpEyaCATN_gxOE0jPkcVyjwETx3q4vRiiodsC3glSQNZrHQ,file_size=65020]"}
{"time": 1754164667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1845584810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1723472704](总之立绘)"}
{"time": 1754164684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2034822973", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我答应，什么条件都可以，只要能救活我朋友”"}
{"time": 1754164722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1962877100", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啊!路见不平拔刀相助，乃侠者之义也。\"你听她咳嗽了两声，说出了这么句话"}
{"time": 1754164783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "876232526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她的腰间似乎挂着长剑，皱着眉走到露莉亚身边，一只手撑起露莉亚的脑袋，\"被侵蚀了吗？\""}
{"time": 1754164802, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1673947490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢你，谢谢你...”感觉今天是最不幸的一天，但如今却又感觉自己还是有一点点幸运的..."}
{"time": 1754164850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1051392202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1928712116]“……把龙晶还给我，再谈其他”*对她伸手"}
{"time": 1754164921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1259906565", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2034822973]（byd看串了）"}
{"time": 1754164922, "type": "recv", "message_id": "824342294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"侵蚀成这样...药水也不管用了啊。\"但她紧接着的话又把你推向了绝望"}
{"time": 1754164970, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1011236864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1051392202]\"现在的你用不了这个。\"她歪着脑袋看你，透露着人畜无害，\"我可以教你，要交易吗？\""}
{"time": 1754164971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1453667990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....怎么会这样...没有其他方法了吗....”"}
{"time": 1754165074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1767580702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1453667990]\"当然有啦，毕竟我有可靠的同伴。\"她又清了清嗓子，\"奈诺!拜托你啦。\""}
{"time": 1754165161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1196858208", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你感觉到有什么东西从她的影子里钻了出来"}
{"time": 1754165164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267345962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=5732177429FB20C78318F03F527E5B9D.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRU71dkjcA1XLrEutPkPehxT-lTcxjouQgg_woorPa-u_bsjgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQoo0NaEEesqs9Tbs7rCECiHoCMSU&amp;rkey=CAQSMP-GqB_sjUS0OdMDgoO-5SLchvQp-Ep3_-LqTUwZUFlZrygLnil9EvHc8krfPa0t1w,file_size=138472]"}
{"time": 1754165184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1394356404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1011236864]“……”"}
{"time": 1754165193, "type": "recv", "message_id": "52014457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你对她的气息无比熟悉，毫无疑问是个魔族"}
{"time": 1754165223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1469708371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“随便吧，反正我已经不剩什么了”颓然向后倒去，仰躺在雪地上"}
{"time": 1754165224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1802479267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有一种突然跌落谷底又飞起来的感觉“太好了，露莉亚，你有救了”抓住她的手"}
{"time": 1754165265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1352624893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她只是扫了你一眼，完全没管你，走到露莉亚身边，手上尖尖的爪子直勾勾地把露莉亚脸上的鳞片剥了下来"}
{"time": 1754165302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2090635437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1469708371]\"好啊\"你的视野里出现了她的脸，\"等价交换，你能给我什么?\""}
{"time": 1754165314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "848764478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2090635437]她似乎是俯身看着你"}
{"time": 1754165335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1576289809", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这样就好了吗...”"}
{"time": 1754165351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1359727668", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉有些不可思议"}
{"time": 1754165379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "799649641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1352624893]几乎是一个呼吸间，你感觉露莉亚的呼吸变得顺畅了很多，奈诺嫌弃地看了你一眼，把鳞片吞下肚，又消失在了影子里"}
{"time": 1754165386, "type": "recv", "message_id": "867184595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……你能帮我什么，我就给你什么”"}
{"time": 1754165428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1914097541", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呼..这样就没事了，啊，刚刚是不是忘了自我介绍?我叫莉夏，是个侠客哦\""}
{"time": 1754165505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "780340152", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=867184595]\"我?\"你看见她撑着自己的脸颊，若有所思，\"救下你的命，帮你抑制了龙晶，清理侵蚀，现在还要拉你到另一个世界里去。\""}
{"time": 1754165534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "176262002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=780340152]你看见她认真地点点头，\"当我的宠物或许是可以的。\""}
{"time": 1754165550, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1876282923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "重新把发带绑好，然后直接给莉夏跪下磕头“谢谢你...如果没有你....我...”一直在压制的情感终于爆发了，大哭了起来"}
{"time": 1754165623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "472327758", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1876282923]\"诶，那个发带?\"她还没来得及问，被你的架势吓到了，立刻把你扶起来，\"别怕别怕，发生什么了？\"看你只穿着单衣，她把自己的袄子脱下来给你披上"}
{"time": 1754165654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1404816050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=780340152]“原来如此……是魔鬼啊”*吐出一口气“天下和地下，只有魔鬼会干这种无聊的事”"}
{"time": 1754165701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "252579385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你想要我的什么？灵魂？”"}
{"time": 1754165737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "784751836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1404816050]\"不是魔鬼，是洋荷。我叫洋荷。\"她的表情依然没变化，但是语速很快，\"嗯?不是说..当我的宠物就可以了吗？\""}
{"time": 1754165780, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1149525260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我对灵魂没有兴趣，但是收集这样的小蛇，很有意思。\""}
{"time": 1754165919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1660124730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……可以，有个条件”"}
{"time": 1754166015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1809158512", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“骗我的人，帮我解决”"}
{"time": 1754166058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "207354561", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢莉夏姐姐....我...”强忍住想哭的冲动“我叫诺薇拉，我和我的朋友出村玩雪，回来...的时候她说她听见了什么...声音，忽然就很难受，我就带她先离开了一会村子，然后...等声音消失了，我回到村子...看到村子里好多好多的人...都死了...只看见两个人还活着，但是之前..从来没见过，一个嘴里嘟囔着什么暗黑议会.. 然后我就带着露莉亚逃跑..但她的状态越来越差..幸好遇到了您”哽咽的说完了发生了什么，一切都发生的太快，一度怀疑刚刚只是个噩梦，但凛冽寒风挂在脸上无不提醒着全都是现实，然后又给莉夏磕了个头"}
{"time": 1754166163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1651845594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1809158512]\"啊...\"你其实感觉她一直有些脱线，这里的反应也很慢，\"可以哦?\"她眨了眨眼，\"说起来，我也应该彻底自我介绍一下...啊..\""}
{"time": 1754166224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1382917246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=207354561]她扶着你，\"没事的...我会帮你们解决。\"说完她把你和露莉亚放在背风处，就准备接着上去"}
{"time": 1754166284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1924462485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“莉夏姐姐小心一些....这个外套还是你穿着吧..我不怎么冷”"}
{"time": 1754166377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "480680978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1651845594]\"司掌言灵的大魔女，厄咒的洋荷。\"她看向你，语气虽然轻飘飘的，但说出名号的瞬间风雪竟也在空中停住，四周的怪物盲目向她叩拜，\"这种程度的魔法。\""}
{"time": 1754166542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "415683447", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1924462485]她对你摆摆手，但也在这瞬间察觉到了变化，扭头朝你们走来，把身上的背包解下来放在你身边，\"这里面有食物和水，等雪停了你们就下山。\""}
{"time": 1754166567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1898826607", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好无聊”依旧躺在地上，不过因为冷而蜷缩起来“……你到底是来干嘛的”"}
{"time": 1754166604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1116930988", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢....我后面怎么才能找到你...我想报恩..”"}
{"time": 1754166707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1877962526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1116930988]\"有缘自会再见。\"她摆摆手往山上走。"}
{"time": 1754166730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1957654709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“明明我想要的……只是很简单的东西”"}
{"time": 1754166745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "229686942", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢....我会一直一直记着的”"}
{"time": 1754166824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1239657892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1898826607]\"来观察你的。\"她偏过头看着你，\"那个人也说过吧？你想要的东西是禁忌。\"她走到你身边，伸手摸了一把头发，似乎是不太习惯，\"但是，这里有隐情哦\""}
{"time": 1754166926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1239453039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"可怜的小蛇，不过就是这样我才会介入观察。\"她好像在思考，\"沐浴的血不干净?好像...是这样?\""}
{"time": 1754166968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "97367434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……一样的”反应过来了什么“和那些毒牙……”"}
{"time": 1754166989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "631581757", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她很快就走远了，你身旁的人呼吸也逐渐平稳，但是还没醒。"}
{"time": 1754167008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1896033661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=229686942]她很快就走远了，你身旁的人呼吸也逐渐平稳，但是还没醒。"}
{"time": 1754167050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1569076224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“太好了，露莉亚....”"}
{"time": 1754167053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1043161789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=97367434]\"啊——\"没有什么起伏的拖长音，\"恭喜恭喜，发现了呢。\""}
{"time": 1754167061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1923686277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd 生存"}
{"time": 1754167061, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1923686277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[露儿]使用[生存]演奏出:[1D20=20]"}
{"time": 1754167062, "type": "recv", "message_id": "144740776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "干巴巴地拍拍手"}
{"time": 1754167068, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2142151058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那你很会生存了)"}
{"time": 1754167074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "579210398", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看能不能升起一堆火"}
{"time": 1754167085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1657947662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(待会你就要说不战斗就无法生存)"}
{"time": 1754167112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "732642996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（hh）"}
{"time": 1754167124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "363549515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”站起身来，往艾络温家的方向走去"}
{"time": 1754167178, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1759806500", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啊?别走别走。\"她从身后抓住你，\"不是做了交易吗？\""}
{"time": 1754167195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "669830307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=579210398]你在她给你的包里找到了少许燃油"}
{"time": 1754167214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1298692279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=669830307]很快就在背风处生起了一团火"}
{"time": 1754167344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "647373096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "让露莉亚靠在自己身上，盯着火堆看...明明昨天一切都还好好的，爸爸妈妈，你们还活着吗...无声的哭泣"}
{"time": 1754167366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "853569324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "叹一大口气“那你还要我干嘛”"}
{"time": 1754167511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "833601109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=853569324]\"哦...是的哦。\"她似乎也不知道要让你干嘛，\"小蛇打算干嘛?\""}
{"time": 1754167577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "614629979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=647373096]洞外风雪飘摇，洞内两人依偎在一起，共同烤着暖洋洋的柴火，也许算得上是这一天中唯一幸运的时候吧。"}
{"time": 1754168079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "6408599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(睡了吗)"}
{"time": 1754168090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1338242349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(跟你们这些昏睡的没什么好说的)"}
{"time": 1754168096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "67807756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(睡觉)"}
{"time": 1754186922, "type": "recv", "message_id": "245180019", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我讨厌你）"}
{"time": 1754186939, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1356942145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我定了一万个闹钟，结果你没醒）"}
{"time": 1754187814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "550741183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我的闹钟也很多，但是我一个都没听到)"}
{"time": 1754187818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1800151940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(太困了)"}
{"time": 1754191451, "type": "recv", "message_id": "347609505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "等雪停或者露莉亚醒来"}
{"time": 1754194071, "type": "recv", "message_id": "547059206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=833601109]“……回家。你都没想好就先拦我？”*又叹气，今天叹气格外多"}
{"time": 1754194209, "type": "recv", "message_id": "568183697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（早上五个闹钟，隔一段时间响一个，起来看看伊神有没有醒，最后一个在10点08，然后昏迷过去了，结果伊神居然醒了）"}
{"time": 1754194257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "130893409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 龙哥醒了，我们继续吧）"}
{"time": 1754194954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "530990612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（结果居然醒了）"}
