{"time": 1754195760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "941534879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（明日方舟宛如qq农场）"}
{"time": 1754195770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "864779309", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（每天上线收菜）"}
{"time": 1754196046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "587299164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=347609505]漫天的飞雪不以人的意志为准，你靠着坐了好一会，肩膀都有些发酸，依然没有要停的迹象"}
{"time": 1754196187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1270325838", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=547059206]“哦。”她松开手，暗橘色的眼睛看着你，但你感觉像是在看着别处，没有再说什么的意思。"}
{"time": 1754196462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1533200496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那也只能等了"}
{"time": 1754196553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1475815460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1270325838]踏在雪上，来时前簇后拥，回去的时候，一切都不一样了。抗寒药物的功效逐渐消退，只得自己裹紧黑袍"}
{"time": 1754196713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1616054892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1475815460]“你打算走回去吗？”她的声音传到你耳边"}
{"time": 1754196837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "241747024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不然呢”没什么力气，声音都有点瑟缩"}
{"time": 1754196908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1127188638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“以后该怎么办呢...大家...”一个人独处的时候就容易胡思乱想"}
{"time": 1754196945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "3795580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉眼泪都快哭干了"}
{"time": 1754197064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1155725037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=241747024]“有点没有建设性...”你听见她的话语带着些困惑，“飞起来不就好了？”语毕的瞬间你的身体毫无征兆地腾空而起，在大雪中迅速远离地面"}
{"time": 1754197340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1596568320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“唔啊啊啊？”体内血液和视线一同下移，或许心脏也忘腹腔沉了沉。四肢突发性僵直，过了好久才反应过来活动“你……”"}
{"time": 1754197481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "572264712", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1127188638]也许是你的祈祷有了效果，\"唔...\"你身旁的女孩终于有了些动静"}
{"time": 1754197525, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1459817442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”摇摇头“算了。之后你要去哪”"}
{"time": 1754197536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1185069853", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露莉亚..太好了...”开心的抱住她"}
{"time": 1754197663, "type": "recv", "message_id": "705596074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1459817442]她仍然站在地面上，微微张着嘴仰视着你，\"你们..不应该很擅长在空中飞行吗?\"感觉有些没有预料的样子，说了句似是而非的话，\"小蛇不是我的宠物吗？\""}
{"time": 1754197759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "416894257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1185069853]她茫然地睁开眼，你却发现她的瞳孔折射着火光，但始终没有焦距，\"...好...暗，诺诺...天黑了?\""}
{"time": 1754197807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "493330649", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=705596074]“你想找更像龙的宠物的话，这片陆地中部有更合适的人选”表情逐渐恢复淡漠，只觉得今天发生的事都像做梦"}
{"time": 1754197871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2047883759", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没有啊...不是生着火的吗...”手在她眼前晃晃“别吓我.....”"}
{"time": 1754197912, "type": "recv", "message_id": "611324218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(诺诺好眼熟，龙族？)"}
