{"time": 1754198279, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1872119685", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（大姐姐也行）"}
{"time": 1754198294, "type": "recv", "message_id": "906818590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我还要去重新训练新的白手套）"}
{"time": 1754198331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "529630018", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=493330649]\"洋荷提出的交易。\"她歪着头看向你，\"小蛇同意了，而且，你现在很像，龙。\""}
{"time": 1754198339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1147791625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(高贵，像龙)"}
{"time": 1754198356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1003048466", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（到时候直接混去当你的手下，骗取你的信任，然后在你进行超级厉害的炼金术的时候，狠狠破坏掉（）"}
