{"time": 1754210266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1042505452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=943659767]\"...诺维拉，诺维拉自己信吗？\"说出的话语带着颤音，\"...我刚刚看见了爸爸妈妈...他们朝我招手...\""}
{"time": 1754210318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2113358147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“肯定有人可以帮你的......刚刚我就遇到了一个厉害的人，没有她我们两个已经死雪地里了....”"}
{"time": 1754210320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1086830851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1712841428]\"诶，你没有看过自己现在的样子吗？\"她移开视线，看着脚下的风景，随后锁定了什么，带着你迅速在雪中下降"}
{"time": 1754210429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "950680194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我？”*低下头扯开衣领撩起袖子"}
{"time": 1754210439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "34781586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“活下去，什么都会有可能的....”"}
{"time": 1754210561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1535214522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "抱住她“至少..至少我们还有彼此...”"}
{"time": 1754210613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "178923872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=950680194]之前双手上涌出的鳞片一直未消散，你透过衣领看下去，立刻看到了身上浮现的大大小小片状分布的龙鳞"}
{"time": 1754210753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1034379676", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦……”*手指轻轻抚摸冰冷的鳞片，呼吸开始急促起来，甚至带着些期待“你有镜子吗？”"}
{"time": 1754210865, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2024834448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1086830851]（还有追杀？）"}
{"time": 1754210890, "type": "recv", "message_id": "716804356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1535214522]\"啊...\"她完全不知道怎么回你的话，默默抽泣起来"}
{"time": 1754210936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1588594173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2024834448]（这已经到家了吧）"}
{"time": 1754210946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1961586540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "拍怕她的背试图安慰她，但自己的泪也止不住的流"}
{"time": 1754211001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1432780581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1034379676]\"没带，撇断，扔掉了。\"她打了个哈欠，带着你穿过风雪停在一个湖前，\"小蛇现在很像。\""}
{"time": 1754211130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1309184904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "现在大概是什么时候，晚上了吗"}
{"time": 1754211212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1112806106", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1309184904]并没有，你估摸着午间刚过不久"}
{"time": 1754211213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1398074647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1432780581]“鳞片……好多”对着镜湖打量着自己，轻笑起来“这样的话……应该能前进三位……说不定有五位”"}
{"time": 1754211303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2085291372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“现在还早，不能继续在等雪停了....必须早点去看医生...我们走吧”"}
{"time": 1754211413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "404158954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1398074647]湖里的自己实在说不上是美丽，四肢上遍布着细细偏向黑紫色的鳞片，瞳孔中也出现了明显的竖缝，\"啊，像蛇一样啊。\"她浮在半空和你一起看着湖面，\"不过不算好事哦?\""}
{"time": 1754211569, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1770511233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我知道”*张开嘴，看看是不是满嘴尖牙“但是能给我带来更多人手，更多材料……还有更多希望”"}
{"time": 1754211676, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1610196892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2085291372]她没有回答，在你身旁闭着眼睛，看上去像是宣泄了情绪之后睡着了"}
{"time": 1754211694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1104591085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉睡着有种好危险的感觉）"}
{"time": 1754211738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "820848066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1770511233]洋荷倒是微微皱起眉头，\"嗯...你没有发现什么区别吗？\""}
{"time": 1754211740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "727703099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd+1 教育关于在雪天背着睡着的人对那个睡着的人来说是不是很危险"}
{"time": 1754211740, "type": "reply", "message_id": "727703099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[露儿]使用[教育关于在雪天背着睡着的人对那个睡着的人来说是不是很危险]演奏出:[1D20+1={3}+1=4]"}
{"time": 1754211749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2007494546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那很不知道了）"}
{"time": 1754211780, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2110708440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2007494546]（那你还有别的办法吗）"}
{"time": 1754211799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "210644032", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=820848066]“什么？”"}
{"time": 1754211813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "550990453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我觉得湖水不是很能照出亮度区分）"}
{"time": 1754212062, "type": "recv", "message_id": "466868806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好像只要不失温就不会有事...”烧点热水，然后背着露莉亚准备继续下山"}
{"time": 1754212077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "911375186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=210644032]\"霞龙的鳞片可不是这样密集偏黑的样子。\"轻描淡写的话传到你耳边，\"凝....\"部分湖面封冻成了一面光滑的冰镜"}
{"time": 1754212128, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1918333503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那我要过什么，教育？博物学？）"}
{"time": 1754212134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "309569389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（虽然没什么区别）"}
{"time": 1754212156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1225533154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把背包正背着，然后背后背着露莉亚下山"}
{"time": 1754212252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "750951876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没区别吧)"}
{"time": 1754212264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1073378317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd"}
{"time": 1754212264, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1073378317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[张风辰]演奏出: 1D20=14"}
{"time": 1754212321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "609402960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我下山不用过什么吧（））"}
{"time": 1754212407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "174562383", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=911375186]这下倒是看得很清楚了，排列的极其细密的鳞片在此刻的天光下显得略微漆黑，紫色完全成了陪衬，这样子和你印象里见过的霞龙宽大氤氲着漂亮的紫的鳞片完全不同，你不由得想起姐姐的尸体，那些鳞片大多被什么东西抓烂的样子。"}
{"time": 1754212426, "type": "recv", "message_id": "16845000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1225533154](大概没什么过的吧)"}
{"time": 1754212576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2142032279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……看起来首要任务是回家”*掐住一片鳞片，深呼吸做好思想准备，随后咬牙猛地发力，尝试拔下来“呃”"}
{"time": 1754212713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1997960746", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "鲜血立刻就随着拔下的鳞片流了下来，痛觉传达到你的神经，就像整块皮肤被取走血肉被剥开的感觉"}
{"time": 1754212740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1329369752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1225533154]山下倒是有个小镇，你抵达时已经将近天黑"}
{"time": 1754212787, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2082180446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“太好了，露莉亚...终于到了”去找医生"}
{"time": 1754212869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "126104748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嘶……”*咬紧牙关，脑袋后仰再前探，摸索着把鳞片收好，然后赶紧把手臂放到冰湖中"}
{"time": 1754213035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "885043390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=126104748]\"这是在做什么?\"好奇的声音传到你的耳边，冬日的湖水寒冷刺骨，一瞬间剧痛感就被另一种麻木的痛感覆盖"}
{"time": 1754213044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "548856200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2082180446](你有钱吗)"}
{"time": 1754213094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "570959164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我可以回家去取）"}
{"time": 1754213143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1314559627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“总得知道我是什么”*待伤口麻木，裹紧衣袍。想来自己后半生可能都离不开这种罩衫了“……该走了”"}
{"time": 1754213268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1358782723", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2082180446]总之，你顺着记忆里来镇子上的经验，很快找到了医生的小诊所"}
{"time": 1754213327, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2098852542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1314559627]\"啊，我有办法哦?\"她没有动，而且彻底降落下来停在了湖面的结冰上。"}
{"time": 1754213411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1818783119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你的办法我买不起”*既然她不动，那就自己步行"}
{"time": 1754213456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1069062279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“医生，快帮我朋友看看，她的眼睛不知道为什么看不见了...”"}
{"time": 1754213510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1117338839", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“而且……多少能猜到一点。也不一定是坏事”"}
{"time": 1754213516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "943380310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1818783119]四面都是湖水，你们毫无疑问停在了湖水中央被外力扭曲的结冰上"}
{"time": 1754213530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "480095438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来不是在湖边？）"}
{"time": 1754213556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "428098637", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1069062279]\"啊啊?看不见?\"医生听到你的话走了过来，\"呃...睡着了。\""}
{"time": 1754213632, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1652180218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们是从山上来的....所以她有点累..有病床吗...我把她先放一下“"}
{"time": 1754213689, "type": "recv", "message_id": "549491379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1117338839]\"不行呢，这样多少失去了些美观。\"她蹙着眉，费力思考了很一会，从不知道什么地方摸出了一块鳞片，\"只有这种才是紫色的鳞片吧？\"扎眼的宽大鳞片出现在她的手心，在昏暗的天光下亦有彩色的折光。"}
{"time": 1754213926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "630325742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1652180218]\"哦哦...\"他带着你进屋，屋里的壁炉里燃着炭火，久违的暖意传到你的五脏六腑"}
{"time": 1754213982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "442656989", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把露莉亚放病床上，摇摇她“醒醒，醒醒，我们到医生那里了”"}
{"time": 1754214206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "640802322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=442656989]完全没有醒来的样子"}
{"time": 1754214214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "701178880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(装睡的人是不会醒的)"}
{"time": 1754214217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1066512353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我知道，但是光好看有什么用”*站在浮冰边缘，思考游泳离开的可能性“好看能活下来吗？能让那些人多为她想一些吗？最多让人死后多收几束花。有什么用？”"}
{"time": 1754214243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "212721526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=701178880]（那能过侦查吗）"}
