{"time": 1754215244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "213128578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我知道你给了我什么”*皱眉“你拿走了什么？”"}
{"time": 1754215246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1996199893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=837530460]\"嘶..哈哈...\"她被你挠了两下最终没有憋住，拦住你的手开口，\"不要...治不好的。\""}
