{"time": 1754216212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "17633907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=627375991]\"呃，小姑娘这话是不是有点...\"医生不知道该说什么，吐槽没常识呢还是太心急，\"我看看吧。\"他上前检查起露莉亚的眼睛"}
{"time": 1754216245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1190788995", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1491668704]*不说话了，不再在意风景，开始认真观察她"}
{"time": 1754216261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1114664191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1267682564]（她有不知道我去卧底，然后相见就是敌人啊，童年最好的玩伴居然背叛了（bushi））"}
{"time": 1754216282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "38558712", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1754216304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "556603319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（虽然这种东西很常见，但确实够扭曲（））"}
{"time": 1754216318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "284517520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实不然）"}
{"time": 1754216328, "type": "recv", "message_id": "672552135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（背叛组织不代表背叛个人）"}
{"time": 1754216520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "996039502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（背叛了指大家说好一起复仇，你怎么在对面（）"}
{"time": 1754216590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "342947907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1190788995]她倒也不在意，或者说你感觉能让她在意的东西几乎没有。脑侧扎着两个团子，让人感觉就很长的金发，标志的脸上嵌着总是很茫然的暗橘色瞳孔，看上去像是普通女孩。但是身上穿着的衣服却很华丽，完全不在乎天气的鲜红短裙，皮质的白色扣衫，象征性披在身上的绣着金纹的纯白斗篷，看上去就价值不菲。但除了头上的发箍，几乎没穿什么饰品。"}
{"time": 1754216620, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1718913965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（先猜一手金龙鱼）"}
{"time": 1754216621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "598160510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=17633907]\"像是先天性的失明。\"医生叹了口气，\"我这里没有什么办法。\""}
{"time": 1754216756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2050562261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=342947907]*不说话了，等回去"}
{"time": 1754216805, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1533183681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么可能.....”"}
{"time": 1754216930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2083051710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1533183681]\"小姑娘是哪里来的?这个天气来看病\""}
{"time": 1754216970, "type": "recv", "message_id": "228327244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2050562261]倒是没有让你久等，不一会儿，鹅毛大雪中城堡的剪影就出现在你的视野中"}
{"time": 1754216996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "671330440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1652180218]（）"}
{"time": 1754217074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "456484698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*待得落地，带着她若无其事地推开门"}
{"time": 1754217156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "999868326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=671330440]\"嗯...山上?你们村里不是有大夫吗？\""}
{"time": 1754217165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "755131106", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“山上的大家....都被暗黑议会的人....”哽咽的说不下去了"}
{"time": 1754217403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1681465536", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "开始大哭起来"}
{"time": 1754217456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1970700343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=456484698]一路上倒是无人拦你，身后的洋荷也没有表现得很新奇，困困地，跟在你身后"}
{"time": 1754217510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "217002544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=755131106]\"诶诶...别哭别哭。\"医生顿时有些手忙脚乱，一边照顾露莉亚一边安抚你，\"山上怎么了？\""}
{"time": 1754217627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1744263404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*嘱咐一下日常管理客房的塞巴斯“这位小姐是我的贵客。给她安排好客房。有什么要求尽量满足”"}
{"time": 1754217689, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1910456096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“还有”顿一下“加雷斯最近做过什么不寻常的事？”"}
{"time": 1754217724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "696293299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我和露莉亚出去....玩雪,回来就...看见...看见大家的尸体在地上...到处都是...就只有两个人站着...嘴里说着什么暗黑议会...然后..我就带着露莉亚跑了.....”继续嚎啕大哭，越想越伤心"}
{"time": 1754217815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2043557748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（尬黑）"}
{"time": 1754217819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "234613858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（只有一个站着）"}
{"time": 1754217873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1859251363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（然后医生说他也是议会的人，直接炸了（）"}
{"time": 1754218006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1442746117", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1910456096]\"好的，伊芙小姐。\"他先是鞠躬表示收到，紧接着开口，\"据我所知，最近很少见到他。\""}
{"time": 1754218072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "547987922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=696293299]\"议会...怎么会在这里?\"医生听到之后顿时有些紧张，走出门检查了一下挂上停业的牌子回来关紧门窗，\"小姑娘...你知道你说的是什么吗？\""}
{"time": 1754218259, "type": "recv", "message_id": "767176213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“行”*摘下兜帽点点头，带着洋荷往她房间去。到位后告诉她自己房间的位置“……虽然我觉得你应该知道”"}
{"time": 1754218321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "527364173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也...不知道他们是谁，也不知道为什么他们要来这...但是我们村里好多好多的人.. 死了...为什么，明明大家都是好人....呜呜呜”"}
{"time": 1754218558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1990189580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=767176213]\"有血腥气的房间又不止你的。\"她看上去确实很困了，推开门，半耷拉的眼睛看了一圈房间内，\"啊..没什么惊喜感。\""}
{"time": 1754218595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1025385202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=527364173]\"...希望不会影响到这边...\"他看着窗外的大雪叹口气，\"你叫什么名字?\""}
{"time": 1754218647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "862383848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...我叫...诺薇拉...”哭的有些上气不接下气"}
{"time": 1754219013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1072193414", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"今天住在诊所吧。\"他做了下决定，\"如果明天镇子还没事的话。\""}
{"time": 1754219067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1688281107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢你...医生先生...”"}
{"time": 1754219156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1721609929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你真是个好人”"}
{"time": 1754219282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "900883653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我在想他晚上干些坏事的事情)"}
{"time": 1754219362, "type": "recv", "message_id": "166520251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（这么惨？）"}
{"time": 1754219381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1599755321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（刚出狼穴，又入虎口？）"}
{"time": 1754219451, "type": "recv", "message_id": "596020609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1754219487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "74222780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1990189580]“这才中午……不过想睡就睡。我还有事”"}
{"time": 1754219610, "type": "recv", "message_id": "504437209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=74222780]\"嗯...\"走进了屋里，想起了什么一样转身对着你开口，\"那个谁小蛇暂时不要动哦?很麻烦的家伙。\""}
{"time": 1754219643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "856207332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1688281107]\"没关系。\"他说着就转身上了楼，把一楼的空间留给了你"}
{"time": 1754219697, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1477337190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“知道了”*觉得这家伙至少可信度相当高。暂时也确实没什么好办法"}
{"time": 1754219793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "828996116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露莉亚..我们去更大的城市吧...我不会放弃的..”"}
{"time": 1754219983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1290438618", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1477337190]\"呼...\"你看着她往床上一倒，几乎沾到床上就没动静了。"}
{"time": 1754220023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "133196837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=828996116]\"...诺诺，眼睛的事你不要再管了...我就留在这里...我不想拖累你...\""}
{"time": 1754220036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1098529625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*回自己的工作间，摘下兜帽。先取些自己的血样，然后上药"}
{"time": 1754220359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1032831308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你准备上药的时候发现伤口几乎快要愈合，血样倒是取得很轻松"}
{"time": 1754220646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "205519278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露莉亚..才不是拖累”用额头贴住她的额头“露莉亚...是我的光...没有露莉亚的话，我早就撑不下来了...”"}
{"time": 1754220940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1213030891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(什么时候就成你的光了)"}
{"time": 1754220953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2062188038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（最后的光）"}
{"time": 1754220990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1887831399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（本来有很多束光，但都逐渐消失了，只剩下最后一束了）"}
{"time": 1754221202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "629420092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1032831308]然后自然是，研究一下鳞片"}
{"time": 1754221506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "455206885", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(怎么研究呢)"}
{"time": 1754221559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1000800941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*首先翻书找找紫黑色鳞片的龙鳞有没有记载。之后看看能不能用这俩片龙类做什么咯"}
{"time": 1754221573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "137640555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=205519278]\"...可是，已经什么都没有了呀。家人村子...父亲母亲...露莉亚已经什么都没有了...\""}
{"time": 1754221875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "348418268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“诺薇拉也没有了很多东西....但是至..诺薇拉还有露莉亚，露莉亚也有诺薇拉....”"}
{"time": 1754222040, "type": "recv", "message_id": "585731005", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我想帮大家复仇，但复仇成功之后呢...我希望至少能有一个人可以见证...所以我不会扔下露莉亚不管的，我也会想办法去治好你的眼睛...”"}
{"time": 1754222133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2082179305", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1000800941]当然没有什么相关的记载，但有一个实证摆在你房间。龙鳞都是死物，你放在一起并没有发生什么变化。真要说的话，黑色细鳞似乎硬一点"}
{"time": 1754222354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "574393875", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=585731005]\"..可是我帮不上忙。\""}
{"time": 1754222378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1363767771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你才十二岁吧，你就说出报仇见证这种话，等你84岁是不是要变成岩窟王了)"}
{"time": 1754222519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1614526184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“啧”*翻了半天没什么头绪，只能点上一支安神的香。但偏偏对有存在感的东西都感到厌烦，遂又掐灭。看着散得到处都是的书籍心生厌烦。"}
{"time": 1754222652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "359228179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "最后抓着鳞片半趴在棺盖上，压抑呼吸的频率，渐渐入眠"}
{"time": 1754222786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1896622869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "棺中人依然那副样子，她身上的鳞片和你之前的细密鳞有些相似，但大多被人为剥夺掉，露出了内里的粉肉"}
{"time": 1754223414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1052870156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好像暂时没活了啊）"}
