{"time": 1754223883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "597639310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“诺薇拉现在也什么都不会....”"}
{"time": 1754223907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "821512795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（那很聪明了）"}
{"time": 1754223958, "type": "recv", "message_id": "496235267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=597639310]“那诺诺还要提什么...报仇之类的话。”她一直闭着眼，以此来回避自己看不见的事实，“...做不到吧”"}
{"time": 1754223981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1692488664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1173464045]房门被人敲响"}
{"time": 1754224019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2056362948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“只要活下去...会有机会的...”"}
{"time": 1754224024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "497544249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*去开门，正好要出去"}
{"time": 1754224272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1981937263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=497544249]你推开门，换了一身黑色睡裙的洋荷站在门外，\"伊芙要出去吗？\"头发解开来披在脑后，颈上挂着一个暗红色的琥珀吊坠"}
{"time": 1754224310, "type": "recv", "message_id": "644024262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2056362948]\"...那..\"她还没说出口的话被突如其来的敲门声打断"}
{"time": 1754224431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "630221110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“对”*点头“去问些事”"}
{"time": 1754224469, "type": "recv", "message_id": "541020792", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=644024262][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 看看从哪传来的"}
{"time": 1754224482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2144098640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=630221110]\"问什么?我也有些兴趣。\"她眯了眯眼，饶有兴趣地看着你"}
{"time": 1754224489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1310498677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=644024262][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 看看是哪个门"}
{"time": 1754224497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "180284378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(大门啊)"}
{"time": 1754224521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1689861219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“露莉亚先等下...”"}
{"time": 1754224543, "type": "recv", "message_id": "113364943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "上楼去找医生“医生先生，好像有人来了”"}
{"time": 1754224587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "442254729", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "医生应声下了门，\"现在不是休息时间吗？\"皱着眉，\"房子都放了。\"但还是下了楼去前面开门"}
{"time": 1754224634, "type": "recv", "message_id": "783135992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦!您好，我来找人。\"你听见了熟悉的声色，莉夏的声音从门口传来"}
{"time": 1754224638, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2115498189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“想知道？”*挑挑眉“那就来交换吧。你来找我干嘛？”"}
{"time": 1754224700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "410512096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“莉夏姐姐....”看到她感觉好像露莉亚的眼睛又有希望了"}
{"time": 1754224744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "251675042", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2115498189]\"又要交换?\"她皱皱眉，\"我来看看伊莉丝小姐。伊芙要做什么?\""}
{"time": 1754224851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1623164951", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“去看看她中的毒从哪里来”"}
{"time": 1754225247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1432980405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我可以帮你哦，复活啦，变正常啦，或者死者说话，都可以哦?\"她笑盈盈地看着你，过了一会才补充，\"交易，对吧?\""}
{"time": 1754225272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "275008136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=410512096]\"你身上的血是怎么回事?\"你听到医生的声音，\"怎么弄成这样\""}
{"time": 1754225338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "493636474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "过去看看"}
{"time": 1754225490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "563519689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你看见，门口的莉夏浑身都是鲜血，但似乎并不是她本人的血，因为你肉眼可见她并没有受伤，看见她出来，她对你打个招呼，“诺维拉！闻到你的味道了。”接着她转头对医生开口，“没事没事，路上遇到了些野兽。”"}
{"time": 1754225568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "386410194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“莉夏姐姐...太好了...还能再次遇到你...”"}
{"time": 1754225623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1747562839", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(技能都这么变态，动不动几千字，我到时候怎么copy呢（)"}
{"time": 1754225709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "459086410", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（我技能236个字）"}
{"time": 1754225720, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1384944765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={36458AF2-4444-DA23-2D66-394EFD42246E}.png,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-36458AF24444DA232D66394EFD42246E/0,file_size=1660]（你copy我就行了）"}
{"time": 1754225741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "406245866", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你的又不厉害（）"}
{"time": 1754225756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1345256656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1432980405]“我说了，你的开价我付不起”*有些沉默“不过很诱人，所以我姑且问问”"}
{"time": 1754225790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1051889234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=386410194]“那也不能不清洗一下啊...”医生皱着眉，但莉夏对他小声说了句什么，他的表情变得震惊，随后陷入沉默，自己转身上楼了。莉夏走向你，“哟，诺维拉，好久不见。”"}
{"time": 1754225843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "506668750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“也没有很久了，谢谢你救了露莉亚....”"}
{"time": 1754225921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "858674827", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1345256656]“诶？你的野心支付不起代价的话，为什么要不顾一切去那个村子？”她好像在笑，你有些不确定，“现在知难而退是不是太晚了。”"}
{"time": 1754226032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "16958306", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=506668750]“没事没事，天乃高且远，安可事事而自下，诺维拉不用道谢来道谢去的啦，毕竟我是侠嘛。”莉夏拍了拍衣服，“没有吓到你吧，突然一身血来找你”"}
{"time": 1754226176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "663912923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看到血又想到了那股惨状，但是已经哭了好久了，稍稍缓过来了一点，“没事..我怎么会害怕莉夏姐姐呢”"}
{"time": 1754226228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "815006098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我朋友已经醒了，莉夏姐姐要去见见她吗.....”"}
{"time": 1754226534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1073470236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=815006098]“哦...小姑娘醒了，怎么样了？”她指了指自己身上的血，显然不太适合去见病人"}
{"time": 1754226564, "type": "recv", "message_id": "455004652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“她的眼睛..看不见了...所以没关系”苦笑道"}
{"time": 1754226572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "571390572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "小声说"}
{"time": 1754226717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "401903300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“看不见了...”她刚想说什么，又停了下来，“清理地不够及时...抱歉。”"}
{"time": 1754226909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2019606027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=858674827]“总能想办法让别人替我付代价的”沉默了会“而且你说太轻飘飘了，我才不信”"}
{"time": 1754227019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1742017479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2019606027]“诶？你好像有点看不起我。”她的笑容透露出一些危险，“伊芙是什么意思呢~”"}
{"time": 1754227189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "594432263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“魔法或许是免费的，但奇迹不是。不论是创造还是目击”又沉默了一会，声如细蚊“其实我知道我做不到”"}
{"time": 1754227292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "116406750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=401903300][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “可能有点贪心了，但是莉夏姐姐有办法治好她吗..”"}
{"time": 1754227330, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1050892929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=594432263]她伸出手摩挲着脖子上挂着的暗红色的琥珀吊坠， “我可以做到，拜托我不就好了？”她笑得怡然自得，像是猎人笃定了捕获猎物。"}
{"time": 1754227369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1872790173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“任何代价一概不论，一切暴行但求有功，这样不就好了？”"}
{"time": 1754227410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "659167458", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=116406750]“我不是医生...这点做不到，抱歉。”她只是叹了口气，“好了，该说别的事了。”"}
{"time": 1754227493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "213752861", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……那你，能保证，她会和原本的样子一样吗？”似乎是带着期许，低着头"}
{"time": 1754227647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "346359840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你可以过个灵感"}
{"time": 1754227805, "type": "recv", "message_id": "606178100", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我？）"}
{"time": 1754227810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "243033913", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd+1"}
{"time": 1754227810, "type": "reply", "message_id": "243033913", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[张风辰]演奏出: 1D20+1={9}+1=10"}
{"time": 1754227815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "245572766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实在憋笑）"}
{"time": 1754227846, "type": "recv", "message_id": "548020871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（因为你也love ruins all了？）"}
{"time": 1754228077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "105962955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=213752861]\"当然啦。\"眼前的人露出笑容，打算越过你进房间，\"只是这种程度。\""}
{"time": 1754228081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1883904414", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=659167458]“什么事？”"}
{"time": 1754228156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1895157471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1883904414]\"诺维拉不是人类吧？\"虽然是疑问句，但她的语气没有丝毫反问的余地，\"魔族吗？你为什么在人类的村子里。\"语气一凛，配合身上的斑斑血迹，隐隐约约有一股杀气"}
{"time": 1754228351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1809932463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哈，好了好了”*笑出声，抬起头来看她“刚刚才被人骗过，我现在不太想听人说这些。说到底，只有我能为她负责，我只相信我了。何况……我还得接她回来，自己先死了怎么行”"}
{"time": 1754228387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1660830958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我....我是被父母捡回来的....我一直把自己当人类看的....”"}
{"time": 1754228405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "92400032", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不要告诉其他人好吗...”"}
{"time": 1754228560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1500076565", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=92400032]\"...你很奇怪。\"她的剑出鞘些许，\"我不知道该不该让你活着。\""}
{"time": 1754228714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1851375465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1809932463]\"哦?\"你发觉她的表情比之前丰富了相当多，几乎是自然地挑了挑眉，在她的眼底你窥见了一抹琥珀色的碎片，\"是吗？\"揶揄之意从话语中铺显，\"你能做到什么?你不是觉得自己无能为力了吗？\""}
{"time": 1754228887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "313674905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....我从来没害过人...而且我觉得我就是人类....”有点发抖"}
{"time": 1754228984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1625008430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1851375465]“总有一天我会做到的。我会自己接她回来”又开始按自己手指的骨节“在那之前，我会不择手段——活得好好的”"}
{"time": 1754229109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1966551361", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=313674905]“...”她皱了皱眉，最后还是把剑收了回去，“你得跟我走。”"}
{"time": 1754229183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1676625001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可以把露莉亚也带上吗...她失明了...而且我们的家人...我不放心她一个人...”"}
{"time": 1754229259, "type": "recv", "message_id": "508613608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1625008430]“是吗？也就是说，你不想跟我谈谈咯？”她露出了一个笑容，你此前并没有在她脸上见过，有些危险，带着一种玩世不恭的偏见"}
{"time": 1754229372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1193411885", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“谈？谈什么？你能证明什么？我能保证什么？”*跟着她一起笑"}
{"time": 1754229410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "24643530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1676625001]“...她知道你的身份吗？”"}
{"time": 1754229477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1108053060", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“除了我的父母之外，大家都不知道...”"}
{"time": 1754229514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1522985357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1193411885]“现在这样，有些没意思诶，之前你明明更有趣一些。”洋荷从你身边退开走了两步，“伊芙小姐呢，时时刻刻都在想着一些阴暗的念头，跟我不是很配吗？”"}
{"time": 1754229793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "839178551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“随你怎么想。没人告诉过你我变脸很快？反正你想要我这条命，有的是借口和手段，我也没必要非讨你欢心不可”*颇有些针锋相对“不过你要是想看戏，我倒是有些感兴趣的小额交易……”"}
{"time": 1754230103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "382510806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1108053060]“那样的话你还要带上她？”"}
{"time": 1754230121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1954691496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她的眉毛皱起来，“她只是个人类。”"}
{"time": 1754230144, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1732379485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我总不能把她一个人留在这里...万一她想不开，我会后悔一辈子的...”"}
{"time": 1754230216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1888550407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=839178551]“是吗？哦...原来你...”她的话又停了下来，“你知道我是什么人吗？”笑意渐浓，“可以说来听听。”"}
{"time": 1754230510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1312359696", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1732379485]\"她跟着你会更不幸。\"似乎是叹了口气，莉夏如是开口"}
{"time": 1754230618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1294020529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1888550407]“加雷斯……或者披着加雷斯皮的其他什么人。从他开始。我要能把他嘴巴撬开的力量”"}
{"time": 1754230668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1026704607", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是...总之我不可能扔下她的...”"}
{"time": 1754230746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "597201750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“她的求生意志已经很弱了...我做不到抛下她...”哭腔"}
{"time": 1754230938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1264433358", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1294020529]\"哎呀哎呀，真的不是乖孩子呢...\"她的语调逐渐变化，或者说其实本就没有怎么模仿，身形也逐渐变小，金发的长发变成一头银发，项链停在胸口变成一只蓝色的蝴蝶结，眼瞳也从暗橘色转为了蓝色，只是仍然穿着黑色的纱裙，\"居然要让洋荷来杀人家，人家好怕啦～\"抬起双手放在眼睛下作势要哭的样子"}
{"time": 1754231002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1406974855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=597201750]\"...你真的知道..\"她最后还是没说什么，\"如果你坚持的话...你自己去跟她说吧，晚上我会再来一趟。\"她转身走向雪中。"}
{"time": 1754231031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1726218016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢你.....”"}
{"time": 1754231066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1658717349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=FA2167C6BC7C009FFE6AB34812D2ADD5.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSwEQdrekImXDyxQO6jnE-OCVO6yhialxEg_woorv_y--vujgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQivy45PlHCs1_S8QPRpVXZXoCF8k&amp;rkey=CAESMPwtPcEWGe0zij_SB2QzbMBSPeXOruzoTPiujxyh5CeLZ04V2Y53nLpouA5Z8H9g3w,file_size=281498]"}
{"time": 1754231073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1809924822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1264433358]("}
{"time": 1754231087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "98712071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "擦一下眼泪，去找露莉亚“露莉亚，有个好消息要告诉你”坐到她的身边"}
{"time": 1754231169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "805896576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好了梅菲斯特大人，你的筹码比我多的多，没必要哄着赌客不下桌”*把玩着那枚紫黑色的鳞片“让我听听报价吧”"}
{"time": 1754231211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1063582824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“之前我不是说有个大姐姐救了我们么，她非常厉害而且人很好，听说我们现在没有地方去之后，她愿意带着我们一起走，而且我有预感，只要跟着她走，我们迟早能找到治好你的办法.....”"}
{"time": 1754231564, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1393242041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=805896576]\"等价交换!bingo\"她打了个响指，一张契约的羊皮卷出现在你的面前，\"签了它，这是对赌协议哦。\"紧接着她摇了摇手，领口的蝴蝶结变成了一只黑色笑脸面具，一只眼睛点缀着蓝色的花，自己浮到她的脸上遮住。"}
{"time": 1754231629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2020410913", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1063582824]\"...我想留在这里，诺诺。\"她没有看你，或者说没有睁开眼，\"我是很普通的人，没有什么才能...跟着你只会拖累，留在这里...挺好\""}
{"time": 1754231668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "375182312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你不是拖累....而且你怎么知道你没有才能....”"}
{"time": 1754231677, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1532931935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*看一眼羊皮卷的内容"}
{"time": 1754231878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1062649098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“和我一起走吧”握住她的手“我们不是最好的朋友么，不管发生什么，我都不会丢下你的...”"}
{"time": 1754231883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "907627275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1532931935]字迹扭曲不清，你感觉墨水甚至在羊皮卷上蠕动，\"你替我，杀了洋荷。\"她的声音从面具下传来，听起来相当愉悦，\"我替你，复活伊莉丝。这就是契约内容哦?\""}
{"time": 1754232127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "895621824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1062649098]\"...\"她的手悬在半空，依然在犹豫"}
{"time": 1754232324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "923709795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "双手握住她的一只手“我想和露莉亚一起活下去....如果只有我一个人...迟早会撑不住的吧.....”"}
{"time": 1754232385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "935361484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，你怎么不干脆给个花火立绘）"}
{"time": 1754232642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "129775468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=907627275]“怎么，你自己做不到？让我猜猜，你和她签过别的契约？”*做出握笔的姿势"}
{"time": 1754232700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2096899229", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=923709795]整个人好像泄了气，最后只是点点头，身体侧过去，你感觉到她有些失落。"}
{"time": 1754232783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "756921460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=129775468]\"嗯哼?\"她的回答不置可否，你看见面具上的嘴巴张张合合，发出尖细的声音，\"我可不想和那种家伙正面对上。\""}
{"time": 1754232802, "type": "recv", "message_id": "155721754", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我需要你，露莉亚....没有你，我什么做不好....谢谢你...你渴吗，我弄点水给你喝”"}
{"time": 1754233047, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1022723796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=155721754]她摇了摇头，陷入了尴尬的沉默，\"什么时候走。\""}
{"time": 1754233094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2123963269", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=756921460]“就这么大方告诉我了？听起来我和她合作有前途得多”"}
{"time": 1754233118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1803471519", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“今晚她说会来再问一下，具体出发的时间没有讲...”"}
{"time": 1754233385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "960203483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2123963269]\"说漏嘴啦说漏嘴了。\"尖细的声音开口，她拍了拍面具，又把面具摘了下来，\"只是对我而言很麻烦，毕竟嘛...你不是想杀我吗？\"说出来她自己似乎有些没绷住，笑得很肆意"}
{"time": 1754233415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "354139145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1803471519]\"嗯...我一个人休息一会，诺维拉。\""}
{"time": 1754233468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1158242580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好...”在一旁安静的坐下"}
{"time": 1754233663, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1855099613", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你骗我一次，还笃定我还会信你？”*挑眉“就不怕我现在把她喊过来？”"}
{"time": 1754233761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1228418297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（这集我见过）"}
{"time": 1754233797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "799381412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1855099613]\"我为什么要管你信与不信?\"她重新遮上面具，\"只是一个选择。\"话语中带着挑衅，\"说起来，你应该多多少少猜到了我的魔法?\""}
