{"time": 1754234318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "491502454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=799381412]“行，那我现在告诉你”*翻出一支笔来“一会我会去找她也签个同款的”"}
{"time": 1754234515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1920244858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=491502454]\"哇哦，我很怕诶。\"她好像不怎么在意，走近你，面具几乎贴在你的脸上，\"复活这种事，只有我做得到哦?\"说完她打个响指，你听到门内传来了扑通一声"}
{"time": 1754234627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "716033665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“什……”*看向门内"}
{"time": 1754235001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1203207350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "姐姐的尸体...或者说是什么，动了一下，似乎是手掌拍了一下棺盖，眼睛睁开来看着你，但是里面现在没有任何神采。"}
{"time": 1754235028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1629483360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1703133477](那你现在很困喵)"}
