{"time": 1754236297, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1523854709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……至少不亏”"}
{"time": 1754236363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1980037141", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1869721884]面具上的表情浮夸地笑着，\"你真有趣，这种契约可是不能后悔的呢...\"契约书上的墨水似乎有了生命一般逐渐顺着你签字的手爬上你的肩膀"}
{"time": 1754236575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2071063485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“至少我可以拖着不做”故作轻松地玩弄头发"}
{"time": 1754236604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1863930821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1406974855]（但现在不就是晚上吗）"}
