{"time": 1754238122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "754101411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "算了，伸手去抓住她，然后努力往岸边移动..."}
{"time": 1754238296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "258164703", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那就不要走...好不好...\"你越陷越深，她的声音也变得清晰，\"和我留在这里。\""}
{"time": 1754238479, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1515700624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“留在哪里....”"}
{"time": 1754238516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "504494802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...留在这里...\""}
{"time": 1754238850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1228930769", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可是...我还要帮大家报仇...我不能停下来，我们一起离开吧..”"}
{"time": 1754238926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1426369862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1246022544]“哈……怎么会杀你呢，恰恰相反，我要送你上天堂呐……”依旧咬牙切齿"}
{"time": 1754238982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1990305422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1228930769]\"...不愿意吗？还是...这样..\""}
