{"time": 1754241740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "517814735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(龙神能猜到吗)"}
{"time": 1754241792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2062100005", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1482289605]（笑谁）"}
{"time": 1754241794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "213345158", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1323397808]\"嗯...呃...\"莉夏想了半天，\"四处走走?\""}
{"time": 1754241842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "274004824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？这种天气吗，对了，莉夏姐姐，你的衣服还你”"}
{"time": 1754241925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "435812675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=842242930]回到房间的瞬间，你目睹了冲击现实的一幕，或者对你来说是这样，水晶棺中的姐姐尸体推开了棺盖坐了起来，看着你语气温柔，\"伊芙?\"姐姐死之后，你终于又听见了她的声音。"}
{"time": 1754241944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "482229214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（原来是面具附身姐姐？）"}
{"time": 1754241986, "type": "recv", "message_id": "269361612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=274004824]\"哦...我的话倒是没什么问题。\"她接过衣服，\"不过你们两个好像不能在这种天气出门...\"她思考了一会，\"先带你们去旅馆吧。\""}
{"time": 1754242253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1219182975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了，我去告诉医生先生一下”"}
{"time": 1754242302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1405415533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"他知道这件事。\"莉夏开口拦住你，\"我们走吧。\""}
{"time": 1754242350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "127215461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=435812675]“姐……”*心下一惊，背已经靠在门上，咔哒一声锁上“姐姐，你……我……”"}
{"time": 1754242387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2091948969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这是假的”心里如是说。但难道能就此逃离吗？"}
{"time": 1754242401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1314701435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哦好，露莉亚用我背着你吗”"}
{"time": 1754242712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "990760697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2091948969]她慢慢站起身，似乎有些不太协调，向你走了过来，走来的路上，身体上的龙鳞龙爪逐渐退化，走到你面前时已经是你记忆里曾经那个伊莉丝，\"伊芙，姐姐是不是教过你...\"她捡起地上的胸针，笑着看向你，\"不要糟蹋别人的礼物吗？\""}
{"time": 1754242730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1468269175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1314701435]\"不要。\"她抓着莉夏的袖子，第一个转身"}
{"time": 1754242847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "268016692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，好吧，可以多麻烦麻烦我的”"}
{"time": 1754242901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "705264967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1305974572]（这个遮眼睛是什么动作？）"}
{"time": 1754242955, "type": "recv", "message_id": "508316827", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……对”大脑在发出危险警报，但心却执拗地抚平紧张的大脑。只要不往脑子里去……就此沉缅一会，也可以吧？“对不起……伊芙做了不该做的事……”"}
{"time": 1754243038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1176372930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=705264967](就是抬手挡住眼睛那一片)"}
{"time": 1754243068, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1624464944", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的...不会是假的吧（）"}
{"time": 1754243132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "700103815", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=508316827]\"真是好孩子。\"她把胸针别在你的胸口，嘴唇靠在你的耳边轻声，\"明明刚刚杀起人的时候...很不乖呢。\""}
{"time": 1754243154, "type": "recv", "message_id": "739245582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1624464944](那你猜吧)"}
{"time": 1754243170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1083264027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉有点奇怪（）"}
{"time": 1754243236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1074834113", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=268016692]你们被莉夏带到了镇上的旅馆，开好了两间房间，安顿好露莉亚，莉夏找到你率先开口，\"我是个侠客，只会用剑。\""}
{"time": 1754243247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "184624702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你要复仇...?\""}
{"time": 1754243339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1908072618", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……他没做错什么……他什么都不知道”慢慢滑靠在她身上，闭上眼，再减少一处感官“我也……什么都不知道”"}
{"time": 1754243339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "165519206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯..我不会让村子里的白白死去的..莉夏姐可以教我吗...我父母是猎户，有教过我一点关于使用武器的事情...”"}
{"time": 1754243622, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1199449180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=3F772672228D121E11FCE06756AAE7F5.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQkUeaRYxnHx6K27c8RkMF3aF4TcxilwQEg_wooud-u35rvjgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQhomqSa80UZgK85_Ce7eVGXoCga4&amp;rkey=CAESMKSPJ65j4n_UnrVzXg27079RDhdGZnhjG4gOOdchvj8JRwcY3Yj4YkIm745xV9Wh0A,file_size=24741]"}
